Name and emblem
---------------
The GPL covers the code, not the project's identity. "Sol JK", "SJK" and the
SJK emblem identify Sol's releases: a modified version must use its own name
and emblem unless Sol agrees otherwise, and must not suggest that it is an
official SJK release. Credit stays: saying a work is based on SJK is welcome and
expected.
